meta {
  name: prep-profile
  seq: 13
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Chained to the contracts-v4 contract created by the parent folder
  (`{{v4_contract_token}}` / `{{v4_contract_id}}` / `{{v4_client_phone}}`).
  Runs after `09 - finalize contract` and before the parent's
  `10 - delete contract + cascade` — prep-profile has no status guard, but a
  soft-deleted contract is no longer resolvable by token or id, so this
  subfolder must run before the delete step.

  Automatable (wired into scripts/run-bruno-e2e.sh):
    01 - get prep profile (public)
    02 - patch prep profile answer (public)
    03 - patch prep profile answers bulk (public)
    04 - unlock prep profile question (admin)

  Manual-only (kept for documentation, excluded from the e2e run):
    05 - create prep profile upload url (public)
    06 - put prep profile upload file (signed url)
    07 - patch prep profile answer - save face photo metadata (public)
    08 - patch prep profile answer - save gift face photo (public)

  05-08 need a real Supabase upload target and Bruno "Developer Mode"
  (request 06 reads a local file via `fs`, see its own docs), so they are
  not safe to run unattended in CI.
}
